WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.612
After classes ended, some students gathered on the field with their pets.

2
00:00:06.613 --> 00:00:11.061
"You may practice for the pet show now," Mr. Freaky announced.

3
00:00:11.062 --> 00:00:15.841
"What if we didn't bring a pet to school?" somebody asked.

4
00:00:15.842 --> 00:00:19.301
"You can help your friends," Mr. Freaky said.

5
00:00:19.302 --> 00:00:24.373
Winnie looked busy with a group of witches, so Ben searched for Mog.

6
00:00:24.374 --> 00:00:28.292
He found his friend working with his two-headed dog.

7
00:00:28.293 --> 00:00:34.207
"Watch this, Ben," Mog called. "Rex-Rex, sit!

8
00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:38.441
"Roll over!

9
00:00:38.442 --> 00:00:41.833
"Fetch!"

10
00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:45.396
Ben was impressed. "He's smart."

11
00:00:45.397 --> 00:00:54.144
Mog nodded. "I entered Rex-Rex in all three competitions at the show—tricks, obedience, and best pet."

12
00:00:54.145 --> 00:00:57.012
"I think he'll win a prize," Ben said.

13
00:00:57.013 --> 00:01:00.317
Mog obviously didn't need help with his pet.

14
00:01:00.318 --> 00:01:04.518
But maybe Waldo did. "Have you seen Waldo around?"

15
00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:07.088
"He took his owl to the science lab."

16
00:01:07.089 --> 00:01:10.963
"Thanks. See you later."

17
00:01:10.964 --> 00:01:15.593
As Ben opened the door, he heard a nervous shout. "Close the door!"

18
00:01:15.594 --> 00:01:20.881
"Okay!" Ben quickly pushed the door closed. "What's going on?"

19
00:01:20.882 --> 00:01:25.860
Waldo wiped sweat from his forehead. "I don't want Oswald to escape."

20
00:01:25.861 --> 00:01:30.507
Ben saw a birdcage, but there was no sign of a bird.

21
00:01:30.508 --> 00:01:36.418
"Uh . . . I hate to tell you this. But it looks like Oswald already escaped."

22
00:01:36.419 --> 00:01:41.499
"No, he didn't," Waldo said. "Oswald is an invisible owl." "Oh,"

23
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:46.886
Ben said. "How do you know he's still here?" Waldo

24
00:01:46.887 --> 00:01:50.299
reached into his pocket and pulled out a cracker. He

25
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:56.398
whistled sharply. "Oswald, come!" Waldo tossed the cracker into the air. Ben

26
00:01:56.399 --> 00:02:01.254
felt a rush of air and then— chomp! The cracker disappeared.

27
00:02:01.255 --> 00:02:04.898
Waldo grinned. "He loves those crackers.

28
00:02:04.899 --> 00:02:07.595
But he's not very good at obeying my commands."

29
00:02:07.596 --> 00:02:12.777
He held up another cracker, whistling twice this time.

30
00:02:12.778 --> 00:02:15.753
Nothing happened for a few seconds.

31
00:02:15.754 --> 00:02:18.465
Then Ben heard a flutter of wings.

32
00:02:18.466 --> 00:02:20.148
"Gotcha!" Waldo cried.

33
00:02:20.149 --> 00:02:23.496
He snatched the invisible bird and whistled again.

34
00:02:23.497 --> 00:02:27.561
With a puff of smoke, Oswald appeared.

35
00:02:27.562 --> 00:02:29.994
"Awesome!" Ben said.

36
00:02:29.995 --> 00:02:32.119
But Waldo was frowning.

37
00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:35.819
"When I whistle, he's supposed to turn visible immediately.

38
00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:40.518
If I can't get him to follow my commands, we're not going to do well at the show."

39
00:02:40.519 --> 00:02:43.467
"Do you want help training him?" Ben asked.

40
00:02:43.468 --> 00:02:50.379
"Sure," Waldo said. "I want Oswald to come whenever I whistle once—no exceptions.

41
00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:55.091
And he should turn visible when I whistle twice."

42
00:02:55.092 --> 00:02:56.853
"Got it," Ben said.

43
00:02:56.854 --> 00:02:59.823
"Oswald is pretty stubborn," Waldo added.

44
00:02:59.824 --> 00:03:03.124
"Plus, he likes to chase small animals and carry them off."

45
00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:08.535
Ben gulped, thinking about all the pets he'd seen yesterday at the pet show.

46
00:03:08.536 --> 00:03:14.907
Most of them, like Winnie's kitten and Mrs. Hubbletree's gecko, were pretty small animals.

47
00:03:14.908 --> 00:03:18.069
"Let's get started," he said.

48
00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:22.649
*** Ben and Waldo spent the next hour training the

49
00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:27.701
owl. After that, it was time to go to the gym for the pet

50
00:03:27.702 --> 00:03:32.439
show. "I'll meet you in the gym in a few minutes," Ben said to Waldo near the school's main

51
00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:36.346
entrance. "My mom is dropping off Sid soon. Good luck with

52
00:03:36.347 --> 00:03:43.543
Oswald." "Thanks." Waldo looked nervous. "I'll need

53
00:03:43.544 --> 00:03:47.571
it." Ben reached into his backpack for his volunteer

54
00:03:47.572 --> 00:03:52.456
badge. He slipped it over his head and then checked his schedule to see what he had to do

55
00:03:52.457 --> 00:03:57.015
first. A second later his mother and Sid

56
00:03:57.016 --> 00:03:59.866
approached. Sid was wearing a volunteer badge

57
00:03:59.867 --> 00:04:03.377
too. "Mom just signed me up as a junior volunteer!" Sid

58
00:04:03.378 --> 00:04:05.725
said. "The office ogre said I can help

59
00:04:05.726 --> 00:04:08.359
you." "Great," Ben

60
00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:10.771
muttered. His mom gave them each a quick

61
00:04:10.772 --> 00:04:15.627
hug. "Remember, Ben, if Sid gets itchy or starts sneezing, call

62
00:04:15.628 --> 00:04:19.884
me." Ben nodded. He and Sid waved as their mom hurried

63
00:04:19.885 --> 00:04:28.282
outside. Then Ben spun to look at Sid. "Do you already have green spots on your hand?"

64
00:04:28.283 --> 00:04:34.401
Sid looked sheepish. "Yes. I petted a cute dog in the hallway."

65
00:04:34.402 --> 00:04:36.939
"I guess we're not getting a dog," Ben said.

66
00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.738
Sid shrugged. "Mom hates dogs anyway."

67
00:04:40.739 --> 00:04:42.625
"Come on," Ben said.

68
00:04:42.626 --> 00:04:46.195
"We have to feed some reptiles first."

69
00:04:46.196 --> 00:04:50.313
He led Sid to an area where some reptile tanks were set up.

70
00:04:50.314 --> 00:04:54.585
There were lizards and snakes of different sizes and colors.

71
00:04:54.586 --> 00:04:57.498
Ben spotted Mrs. Hubbletree's terrarium.

72
00:04:57.499 --> 00:05:02.060
Her rainbow gecko, Bowie, sat on a small branch inside it.

73
00:05:02.061 --> 00:05:08.738
Sid was staring at some snakes. "Ugh! I hate snakes."

74
00:05:08.739 --> 00:05:11.568
He backed away as a snake hissed.

75
00:05:11.569 --> 00:05:13.967
"I'll feed the snakes," Ben said.

76
00:05:13.968 --> 00:05:15.420
"You can feed the lizards.

77
00:05:15.421 --> 00:05:23.427
If you have any problems with spots or sneezing, let me know."

78
00:05:23.428 --> 00:05:29.301
By the time they were finished with the job, green spots dotted Sid's arms and legs.

79
00:05:29.302 --> 00:05:31.628
"Rats!" Sid said.

80
00:05:31.629 --> 00:05:35.708
"Yeah," Ben said. "You're covered with spots."

81
00:05:35.709 --> 00:05:38.119
"No." Sid shook his head.

82
00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.446
"I said 'rats' because I wanted to check out the rodents next.

83
00:05:41.447 --> 00:05:44.143
Maybe I'm not allergic to them."

84
00:05:44.144 --> 00:05:47.368
"Okay." Ben nodded and checked the time.

85
00:05:47.369 --> 00:05:49.894
"We might see some rodents at the pet parade.

86
00:05:49.895 --> 00:05:54.466
It starts on the stage in a few minutes."

